      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I've already tried grouping by vendor but the amounts are so random that it doesn't immediately point to a specific supplier. It's almost like they are just drifting between different categories. What other specific metrics or data points should I be cross-referencing to find the root cause of these little slippages? I'm trying to figure out if it's a specific person's mistake or something more systemic.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
