    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good point about the timing. I'll check the logs against the timestamps. One thing that's really bothering me is that these amounts are so small—even the \"large\" ones are barely enough to buy a box of pens. It feels very... I don't know, petty? Like they are almost intentionally hiding in the noise of the larger transactions. Do you think there's a way to flag these specifically as \"anomalous\" in our software without flagging every single small transaction?",
